  "body": "A rare opportunity to secure a brand-new, high-end home in the heart of Mairangi Bay — and have a say in the finishing touches.\r\n\r\nStep into contemporary coastal luxury with this stunning near-completion, Kiwi-built residence, designed for effortless living in one of Auckland’s most sought-after seaside suburbs.\r\n\r\nFeaturing two generous bedrooms, two beautifully appointed bathrooms and an additional study, this thoughtfully designed home delivers the perfect balance of style, space and functionality. Designer finishes, sophisticated living zones and quality craftsmanship come together to create a home that feels both luxurious and wonderfully liveable.\r\n\r\nJust a short stroll from Mairangi Bay village, you’ll enjoy boutique shopping, vibrant cafés, local restaurants and the beachside lifestyle that makes this community so special.\r\n\r\nWhether you’re a professional couple, busy executive, small family or seeking the ultimate lock-and-leave retreat, this is an opportunity to embrace easy coastal living without compromise.\r\n\r\nHere’s the exciting part — the home is nearly built, giving you the opportunity to get in early and be involved in selecting the final finishes, subject to availability. Make your mark on a brand-new home and create a space that reflects your own taste and style.\r\n\r\nSpend your weekends by the beach, enjoy village life on your doorstep, or lock up and leave knowing your coastal sanctuary is ready whenever you are.\r\n\r\nOpportunities like this are rare. Get in early, have your say, and secure your place in Mairangi Bay.\r\n\r\nContact us today to arrange a viewing and discover the possibilities before the finishing touches are complete.",
